# round 75 (w94): the two controls of the layer-free cell on repeated outer split 0, so the solve vector gain (0.908 against 0.890 with the FBA ratios alone and 0.860 with no metabolism, on the released held-out genes) is read as a paired difference per split. Arms: pathway + ProtT5 with the FBA ratio affine (round-22 recipe, protpathfba) and pathway + ProtT5 with no readout (pathpool). Three seeds each. Never the reported number.
